      players: '3 is the traditional count.',
      deck: '52 cards. Each player receives 3 cards initially; 7 more face-up to the tableau (3 players) or 4 (4 players); remainder as talon. After each round when hands are empty, deal 3 more each from talon.',
      equipment: 'Counters (jetons, fiches) for scoring.',
      dealing: "Deal 3 cards each to hand (first hand to dealer's left), then 7 face-up to the tableau (4 in four-hand). Stack the remainder face down as talon. When all hands are empty, deal 3 more each from talon.",
